*.rsuser
*.vcxproj.user
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.opendb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.cachefile

## WSL ↔ Windows 混合工作流
compile_commands.json
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# 本机 codegraph 索引，规则详见于 .codegraph/.gitignore
.codegraph/*
!.codegraph/.gitignore

